#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux
msgid ""
"Scans I<$PATH>, I</lib>, I</usr/lib>, I</usr/local/lib> and I</etc/"
"ld.so.conf.d/*.conf> directories for ELF files with references to missing "
"shared libraries, and suggests which packages might need to be rebuilt. The "
"collected data is written to a temporary directory created by mktemp."
